---
title: Paella
servings: 2
prep time: 10m
cook time: 30m
course: Main
locale: en
difficulty: Medium
cuisine: Spanish
---

In a large frying pan melt @butter{25%g}, add the @red onion{1}(diced) and @garlic{1%clove}(chopped finely) and cook until soft, add the @short grain rice{125%g} and @red pepper{1}(sliced) (if using @?chicken{100%g}(diced cooked) add at this stage) and gently cook for ~{1%minute}.

Then add the @fish stock{300%ml} and @saffron{pinch} and stir well.

Bring to the boil. Cover and simmer gently for ~{15%minutes} stirring occasionally.

Increase the heat and add the @tomatoes{2}(chopped), @peas{50%g} and @fruits de mer{400%g}(defrosted) and stir well.

Reduce heat again, cover and cook for a further ~{10%minutes} stirring occasionally.